sequenceDiagram
    participant U as 用户
    participant Q as Query Loop
    participant C as 当前会话消息
    participant CP as Compact

    U->>Q: 提问
    Q->>C: 读取 messages
    C-->>Q: 当前会话上下文
    Q->>Q: 发模型请求
    Q->>C: 追加 assistant / tool results

    alt 上下文过长
        Q->>CP: 触发 compact
        CP-->>C: compact_boundary + summary + recent messages
    end